content:
@everyone Anyone wanting to run the Sorrow of the Statues, Starting this week there will be an optional side quest. It will have unusual mechanics, so I wanted you all to be aware. You will be playing strangers in the town. Npcs. With commoner stats. If your a caster, take one cantrip. Your gear will be starting gear for your class. You will need to venture into a labyrinth with little else but their wits. Though the danger be deadly, your love ones can rest assured. Don't feel bad for killing some commoners. They are all named chad. Look up the Commoner statblock. Up to 6 people at a time.
Here are the extra tools available. Distribute them amongst your party.
One Healing Potion. One set of 50 ft hemp rope and pitons. One Ladder- 15 foot. One 10 foot pole. One bag of caltrops or ball bearings. or One plus 1 dagger. Pick one of these items per player. Players may not pick the same item.
